  "releaseNotes": "## New Version\n* Bump `net_conduit` from `2.0.2` to `2.0.3`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit/2.0.2...net_conduit/2.0.3)\n\n## What's Changed\n* Bump System.Security.Cryptography.Xml from 9.0.0 to 9.0.15 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/48\n* Bump NuGet.Packaging from 6.12.1 to 6.12.5 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/49\n* Bump NukeBuildHelpers from 9.0.13 to 9.0.14 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/51\n* Bump System.IO.Pipelines from 10.0.5 to 10.0.6 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/52\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/build.20260414090113.8f30eac...build.20260415125515.a8c3df6",
